    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "37d5bb70f90700c5d35a": "I want to browse your goods.",
        "3955ac2298cfd94302dc": "Welcome to my shop, $c. What is it the Goodstitch brothers can do for you?",
        "4ffda7e323b73ac5132f": "Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $n. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.$B$BMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it's only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.$B$BI am but a little envious."
      },
      "name": "Xizk Goodstitch",
      "subName": "Tailoring Supplies",
